{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FnAKVbfZNFK8wtZrNWQMHj","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — gen-depth-contamination\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR submission May 25, 2026)\n5\t- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n6\t- Backup: AAAI 2027 (abstract July 25, paper August 1)\n7\t\n8\t## Canonical Experimental Condition\n9\t\n10\t**Continuation mode 是 cross-model 结论的基础。**\n11\t\n12\t> \"We evaluate both generation modes because real-world recursive contamination can arise from either. Our analysis reveals generation mode as a significant confound, leading us to recommend continuation mode as the canonical condition for cross-model comparisons.\"\n13\t\n14\t| Condition | Pythia↔OLMo | Qwen↔others | 论文定位 |\n15\t|-----------|-------------|-------------|---------|\n16\t| Continuation | 90-92% retention | 80-85% retention | **主实验条件** — cross-model claims 的基础 |\n17\t| Rewrite (instruction) | N/A | 61-63% retention | **upper bound with mode-specific confound** — 仅作 ablation |\n18\t\n19\t**原则**：\n20\t- C1' 的跨模型 claim 必须基于 continuation mode 数据\n21\t- Rewrite mode 的高 AUC (0.6957 vs cont 0.6114) 是 mode-specific signal amplification，不能作为泛化性证据\n22\t- mvp-001 (Qwen-rewrite) 定位为 \"pilot study demonstrating feasibility\"，后续用 continuation mode rigorously validate\n23\t- cont→rw 89% vs rw→cont 82% 不对称性 → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n24\t\n25\t## Core Claims (2+1 结构, updated D049/D050)\n26\t\n27\t### Primary: C1' (K* Characterization — Domain-Dependent Bounded Saturation)\n28\t首次系统测量递归合成文本的 generational discrimination boundary K*，demonstrating that K* is low-bounded (≤3) and domain-dependent。\n29\t\n30\tDPI 理论证明有限 K*_theory 必然存在（信息论 impossibility boundary）；我们首次在受控实验中测量 K*_empirical，它提供 K*_theory 的保守下界。通过 8 model configurations（5 architecture families, 1B-8B）、3 source domains（C4, Wikipedia, arXiv）、4 decoding strategies 系统表征 K*_empirical 的行为，发现：\n31\t\n32\t- **K*∈{1,2,3} at θ=0.60**：K* 是有界的且域依赖的，呈现三级域阶梯：Wikipedia(1) < C4(2) < arXiv(3)\n33\t- **Web text K*=2 是 dominant mode**（7/8 configurations），展现跨模型架构、跨解码策略的一致性\n34\t- **Structured academic text (arXiv) K*=3**，经五个模型配置、四个架构族 cross-validate（Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-7B, Pythia-1.4B, LLaMA-8B, Mistral-7B; 5/5 domain-competent models, 100%）\n35\t- **Wikipedia K*=1 (scorer-controlled)**：全部 6 个模型在 cross-family scorer 控制后均 K*=1。Qwen 生成器在 same-family scorer 下的 K*=2 是 scorer family bias artifact（D060 确认），正文报告 scorer-controlled 值，Appendix 披露 confound 细节\n36\t- **Mistral-7B K*=1 on C4 but K*=3 on arXiv**：domain-specific one-wash，最强 domain dependence 证据\n37\t- **Domain 是 K* 的唯一主导因素**：scorer control 后，model scale/architecture/decoding strategy 均不改变域内 K* 一致性\n38\t- **One-wash laundering effect**：对 web text 和 Wikipedia，单次生成即令文本与更深层合成内容不可区分\n39\t\n40\t**子组件：**\n41\t\n42\t**(a) K*=2 as dominant mode for web text (7/8 configurations)**\n43\t> **7/8 model configurations yield K*=2 on C4 web text：**\n44\t>\n45\t> | Model | Experiment | AUC 1v2 | 95% CI | CI lower > 0.60? |\n46\t> |-------|-----------|---------|--------|-----------------|\n47\t> | Qwen-1.5B-Instruct rewrite | mvp-001 | 0.6957 | [0.6859, 0.7041] | ✅ (+8.6pp) |\n48\t> | Pythia-1.4B cont | exp-001 | 0.6539 | [0.6454, 0.6630] | ✅ (+4.5pp) |\n49\t> | Qwen-1.5B base cont | exp-016 | 0.6262 | [0.6168, 0.6353] | ✅ (+1.7pp) |\n50\t> | Qwen2.5-7B cont | exp-004 | 0.6178 | [0.6079, 0.6261] | ✅ (+0.79pp) |\n51\t> | OLMo-1B cont | exp-002 | 0.6145 | [0.6045, 0.6247] | ✅ (+0.45pp) |\n52\t> | LLaMA-3.1-8B cont | exp-018 | 0.6123 | [0.6028, 0.6216] | ✅ (+0.28pp) |\n53\t> | Qwen-1.5B-Instruct cont | exp-017 | 0.6112 | [0.6015, 0.6213] | ✅ (+0.15pp) |\n54\t>\n55\t> *Exception: Mistral-7B cont (exp-019): 1v2=0.5935, CI [0.5835, 0.6032], K*=1*\n56\t>\n57\t> *Decoding strategy invariance (exp-003):*\n58\t> | Decoding | AUC 1v2 | K* |\n59\t> |----------|---------|-----|\n60\t> | greedy | 0.6893 | 2 |\n61\t> | nucleus p=0.9 | 0.6866 | 2 |\n62\t> | temp=0.7 | 0.6887 | 2 |\n63\t> | temp=1.2 | 0.7039 | 2 |\n64\t>\n65\t> - 7/8 configurations 1v2 CI lower > 0.60, 全部 2v3 CI upper < 0.60\n66\t> - 4 decoding strategies AUC 1v2 range [0.6866, 0.7039], K* 完全不变\n67\t> - ⚠️ Qwen-cont 1v2 CI lower=0.6015 极边缘；cross-scorer validation 下降至 K*=1\n68\t> - ⚠️ θ-sensitivity: θ=0.60 下 7/8 K*=2; θ=0.70 下多数降至 K*=1\n69\t> - Paper 措辞：\"K*=2 emerges as the dominant mode for general web text (7/8 model configurations), demonstrating consistency across diverse architectures and decoding strategies.\"\n70\t\n71\t**(b) Domain dependence: arXiv K*=3 (5-model cross-validated, D055/D056/D057)**\n72\t> - **Qwen-1.5B on arXiv** (exp-024): 2v3 AUC=0.6427, CI [0.6275, 0.6575], K*=3 ✅ (+2.75pp)\n73\t> - **Pythia-1.4B on arXiv** (exp-025): 2v3 AUC=0.6544, CI [0.6401, 0.6688], K*=3 ✅ (+4.01pp)\n74\t> - **LLaMA-3.1-8B on arXiv** (exp_arXiv_llama8b): 2v3 AUC=0.6215, K*=3 ✅ (+2.15pp)\n75\t> - **Mistral-7B on arXiv** (exp_arXiv_mistral7b): 2v3 AUC=0.6275, all folds > 0.60, K*=3 ✅ (+2.75pp)\n76\t> - **Qwen-7B on arXiv** (exp_arXiv_qwen7b): 2v3 AUC=0.6255, all folds > 0.60, K*=3 ✅ (+2.55pp)\n77\t> - 五个模型配置、四个架构族（1.4B-8B）在 arXiv 上 100% 一致 K*=3（5/5 domain-competent models，仅 OLMo capacity failure）\n78\t> - OLMo-1B K*=1 (exp_arXiv_olmo): capacity failure — 生成完全出域文本，不影响 domain property claim，作为 \"domain competence prerequisite\" 分析放 Appendix\n79\t> - **Mistral C4 K*=1 → arXiv K*=3 是 domain dependence 的最强证据**：同一模型在不同域给出不同 K*，证明 K* 由 domain structure 主导而非 model identity\n80\t> - **解释**：arXiv 的结构化特征（LaTeX formatting, citation patterns, mathematical notation）提供额外 depth-distinguishing signal，使辨别力多延伸一代\n81\t> - Sample size: n=2,200 per model\n82\t> - ⚠️ LLaMA fold 0=0.5969 < θ, bootstrap CI lower 可能接近 0.60 边界。论文措辞用 \"K*=3 with boundary pair AUC of 0.62\" 而非 \"robustly K*=3\"\n83\t> - 论文定位：**domain dependence 是核心发现**——K* 由源文本结构复杂度决定，非纯模型属性。4-model cross-validation 大幅强化证据链\n84\t\n85\t**(c) Mistral K*=1 on web text: domain-specific one-wash (D056)**\n86\t> - Mistral-7B 在 C4 web text 上 1v2 AUC CI lower < 0.60, K*=1\n87\t> - Cross-scorer validation (exp-022): 使用其他模型 score Mistral 生成的文本，K*=1 maintained → C4 上的 K*=1 是 text-intrinsic（非 scorer artifact）\n88\t> - **但 Mistral arXiv K*=3 (exp_arXiv_mistral7b) 证明 one-wash 是 domain-specific 而非 model-intrinsic**\n89\t> - **One-wash laundering**：对 web text 这类 homogeneous 域，Mistral 单次生成即令文本在统计上不可区分于更深层合成；但 structured domains (arXiv) 能 rescue even Mistral from one-wash\n90\t> - 论文定位：Mistral C4→arXiv 的 K* 跃变（1→3）是 (model × domain) interaction 的典型案例，进一步证明 domain structure 是 K* 的主要决定因素\n91\t\n92\t**(d) Cross-model transfer (scorer invariance)**\n93\t> - Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention → K* 不是 model self-familiarity artifact\n94\t> - 0v1 AUC > 0.96 across all transfer pairs → binary contamination signal 完全跨模型可迁移\n95\t> - Cross-scorer validation (exp-022): 11/12 generator×scorer combos yield K*=2 → K* governed by generation process, not scoring model\n96\t> - Feature ordering: scorer-invariant Spearman ρ > 0.90\n97\t> - 论文定位：confirms K* is a property of the text/generation process, not the measurement apparatus\n98\t\n99\t**(e) Representation dependence of K* (Neural Probe)**\n100\t> - exp-015 完整 3 模型结果（frozen self-embeddings + MLP probe）:\n101\t>   - Qwen-cont: K*(neural)=3, 2v3 AUC=0.6159, CI [0.6099, 0.6223], CI lower > 0.60 ✅\n102\t>   - Pythia-1.4B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5963, CI [0.5892, 0.6033], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n103\t>   - OLMo-1B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5892, CI [0.5818, 0.5965], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n104\t> - K*(neural) 是 model-dependent：Qwen K*=3, Pythia/OLMo K*=2\n105\t> - 15D model-free features 给出一致的 K* across all models，neural probe 给出 model-dependent K*\n106\t> - Interpretability-deployability tradeoff: model-free features 的 universality 优势在 cross-model 结果下更明显\n107\t> - 论文定位：validates choice of model-free 15D features for headline characterization\n108\t\n109\t**(f) Generation mode analysis (§4.x Analysis subsection)**\n110\t> - Signal strength: rewrite AUC 1v2=0.6957 vs continuation 0.6114（Δ=+8.4pp）\n111\t> - Transferability: continuation 80-92% retention vs rewrite 61-63%\n112\t> - Feature subset: cont→rw 89% > rw→cont 82% → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n113\t> - Interpretation: rewrite mode 的 instruction-following 引入 mode-specific style artifacts，放大 depth signal 但降低跨模型泛化性\n114\t> - 论文定位：Analysis subsection，不是独立 claim\n115\t\n116\t### Secondary: C3 (K*-Aware Data Curation Validation)\n117\tDomain-appropriate K* correctly predicts optimal curation granularity: for web text (K*=2), binary K*-aware filtering (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms graduated depth weighting (best 0.5892 at α=0.9), surprisal-based selection (0.5894), and DSIR distribution matching (~0.5867, ≈ no-filter level). Dose-response analysis (exp-009 v3, 3 ratios × 3 strategies × 5 seeds) confirms binary filtering maintains consistent advantage across 10%/30%/50% contamination ratios (HellaSwag significantly better at all levels, p≤0.004), while graduated filtering collapses to no-filter baseline performance. K* serves as an actionable curation guideline: the domain-dependent discrimination boundary directly determines the optimal filtering granularity.\n118\t\n119\t> ⚠️ Defensive framing constraint (D053): MMLU at 30% ratio p=0.074 不显著, 不能 claim \"universally beneficial\"。维持 \"consistent advantage\" 措辞，以 HellaSwag 显著性为主要证据。\n120\t\n121\t### Supporting Analysis: Canonical Condition Selection\n122\tGeneration mode 是 depth estimation 的显著混淆变量。Methodology 段落阐述 continuation mode 作为 canonical condition 的选择及理由（不作为独立 claim）。\n123\t\n124\t## Story Spine\n125\t\n126\t- **Problem**: Web 数据正被多代递归合成文本污染。当前检测方法将合成文本视为 binary 类别（real vs synthetic），但质量随代际深度非线性退化——首代合成文本与四代合成文本的质量差异巨大却被忽视。\n127\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Binary detectors (DivEye, Min-K%++) 不区分代际；model collapse 文献 (Shumailov et al., Alemohammad et al. 2024, Dohmatob et al. 2024) 描述宏观现象但不提供检测工具；data selection methods (DSIR, D4, DoReMi) 做分布匹配但不估计递归深度；Drayson et al. (2025) 将 binary MGT detection 应用于 importance resampling 以防止 model collapse，是目前最接近的工作。然而这些方法均做二值判断，**不估计文本经历了多少轮递归生成，也不量化辨别能力的饱和边界。**\n128\t- **Our framing**: 将递归生成建模为 iterated lossy channel，从信息论（DPI）推导出 K* 的必然存在。K* 是首次系统测量的 operational quantity——它告诉数据策展者\"在什么深度以下，depth-aware curation 比 binary detection 更有价值\"。通过 8 model configurations（5 architecture families, 1B-8B）、3 source domains、4 decoding strategies 系统表征 K*，揭示其 **bounded domain-dependent** 本质：**K*∈{1,2,3}**，形成清晰的三级域阶梯——Wikipedia K*=1（6 models, scorer-controlled），C4 web text K*=2（7/8 configurations），arXiv K*=3（5/5 domain-competent models, 4 architecture families）。Domain 是 K* 的唯一主导因素：scorer confound 控制后，model identity/scale/decoding strategy 均不改变域内一致性。这一发现意味着递归生成信息丧失极快——one to two generation passes suffice to erase distinguishable depth structure（\"one-wash laundering\" effect）。Domain dependence 为数据治理提供 actionable guidance：源文本的结构复杂度决定了 depth-aware filtering 的适用粒度。\n129\t- **Headline result template**: \"Recursive generation has a bounded discrimination boundary at K*∈{1,2,3}, forming a three-level domain hierarchy: Wikipedia saturates at K*=1 (all 6 models, scorer-controlled), web text at K*=2 (7/8 model configurations, 5 architecture families, 1B-8B), and structured academic text extends to K*=3 (cross-validated across 5 models, 4 architecture families). Domain structural complexity is the sole systematic determinant of K*. Cross-model transfer retention of 80-92% and scorer-invariant feature ordering (ρ>0.90) confirm depth features are text-intrinsic. Domain-appropriate K* correctly predicts optimal curation granularity.\"\n130\t\n131\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n132\t\n133\t1. **\"K*∈{1,2,3} 范围太小，结论是否 trivial？\"** → 恰好相反：K* 的低有界性是核心发现。DPI 理论只保证 K* 有限但不给上界；我们首次实证表明 K*≤3（即递归信息丧失极快），且 domain dependence 揭示了结构化文本如何延缓信息退化。One-wash laundering effect 对 data governance 有直接实践意义。\n134\t2. **\"只基于小模型（≤8B），能推广到更大模型吗？\"** → 5 architecture families (1B-8B) 覆盖了当前开源生态的主要架构。DPI 理论保证 K*_theory 对任意规模模型存在。Cross-scorer validation 表明 K* 由生成过程而非评分模型决定。扩展至 13B+/70B+ 是重要 future work。\n135\t3. **\"只是 feature engineering + off-the-shelf classifier，方法贡献弱\"** → 贡献在 problem formulation + empirical characterization（首次测量 K*）+ 理论框架（DPI）+ domain-dependent bounded saturation 发现，不是分类器本身。Model-free features 的选择被 cross-model transfer 80-92% 和 scorer invariance 验证为正确设计。\n136\t4. **\"arXiv K*=3 样本量够吗？\"** → 五个模型（Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-7B, Pythia-1.4B, LLaMA-8B, Mistral-7B）跨四个架构族均给出 K*=3，每模型 n=2,200，bootstrap CI 确认统计显著。5/5 domain-competent models 100% 一致性排除 model-specific artifact。\n137\t5. **\"Mistral K*=1 是 outlier 还是 systematic？\"** → Cross-scorer validation 确认是 text-intrinsic（非 scorer artifact）。Mistral 可能因训练数据/alignment 差异导致生成文本在一代后即失去 depth-distinguishing structure。这强化了 domain/model dependence 的核心论点。\n138\t6. **\"Prompt-chain 不代表真实世界递归污染\"** → Prompt-chain 隔离纯文本退化效应（text-intrinsic degradation），是更 generalizable 的实验设计。**exp-008 实证验证**：retrain-chain (Pythia-1.4B LoRA) K*≥4（1v2=0.9484, 2v3=0.8888, 3v4=0.7982），远高于 prompt-chain K*=2。原因：LoRA fine-tune 每代引入累积模型 artifacts（vocabulary narrowing, repetition bias），使各代高度可区分。这些 model-adaptation artifacts 是 setup-specific 的，不泛化到 wild contamination scenarios。因此 prompt-chain K*=2 是 data curation 的 operational boundary（仅反映 text-intrinsic information loss），而非 retrain-chain 的 upper bound。\n139\t7. **\"同模型做生成和 surprisal 计算有 bias\"** → **exp-013/exp-022 直接反驳**：cross-scorer validation 11/12 combos yield K*=2, Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention。K* governed by generation process, not scoring model。**D060 进一步证实**：Wikipedia 上 Qwen same-family scorer 的 +1 bias 被 Pythia cross-family scorer 消除（K*=2→1），证明 scorer confound 可被检测和控制，且仅影响特定 model-family×domain 组合（不影响 C4 主线结论）。\n140\t8. **\"为什么不用 learned representations\"** → **exp-015 直接回应**：neural probe K* 是 model-dependent（Qwen=3, Pythia/OLMo=2），而 15D model-free features 给出一致的 K* across all models。Model-free 方案的 universality + cross-model transferability 是 practical advantage。\n141\t9. **\"θ=0.60 选择是否 arbitrary？\"** → 三层辩护：(1) Cohen's h≈0.20 small effect size threshold, (2) permutation test 校准, (3) AUC gap 在 boundary 处的 sharp discontinuity（1v2 vs 2v3 gap 大于 θ 选择的 sensitivity range）。θ-sensitivity analysis [0.55, 0.70] 在主文呈现。\n142\t10. **\"Graduated filtering 没和 data selection methods 比\"** → exp-006 包含 DSIR baseline + α sensitivity sweep，binary K*-aware filtering outperforms all tested alternatives。\n143\t\n144\t## Venue Fit\n145\t\n146\t- EMNLP 2026 special theme 明确呼吁 data contamination, synthetic data feedback loops, data governance 方向的工作\n147\t- 2+1 claim 结构：C1' 是 comprehensive characterization study with domain-dependent bounded saturation finding，C3 是 practical application，generation mode analysis 增加深度\n148\t- **Domain-dependent bounded saturation narrative** 比 universality 更准确且更有 impact：K*∈{1,2,3} 的 bounded range + domain dependence 是 nuanced scientific finding，比 \"K*=2 everywhere\" 更可信且更 interesting（审稿人不必怀疑过度外推）\n149\t- One-wash laundering effect 是 memorable concept 便于传播\n150\t- 风险：K* range 小（1-3）可能被认为 trivial → 论文须强调 bounded ≤3 本身是 surprising（DPI 不给上界），且 domain dependence 是 actionable（不同域需不同 curation 策略）\n151\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"77007605-4c46-46a1-9837-c424a2ae6462","uuid":"8ee42695-26cc-46db-bfaa-7295510daab0","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:15:46.234Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125757/best/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — gen-depth-contamination\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR submission May 25, 2026)\n- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n- Backup: AAAI 2027 (abstract July 25, paper August 1)\n\n## Canonical Experimental Condition\n\n**Continuation mode 是 cross-model 结论的基础。**\n\n> \"We evaluate both generation modes because real-world recursive contamination can arise from either. Our analysis reveals generation mode as a significant confound, leading us to recommend continuation mode as the canonical condition for cross-model comparisons.\"\n\n| Condition | Pythia↔OLMo | Qwen↔others | 论文定位 |\n|-----------|-------------|-------------|---------|\n| Continuation | 90-92% retention | 80-85% retention | **主实验条件** — cross-model claims 的基础 |\n| Rewrite (instruction) | N/A | 61-63% retention | **upper bound with mode-specific confound** — 仅作 ablation |\n\n**原则**：\n- C1' 的跨模型 claim 必须基于 continuation mode 数据\n- Rewrite mode 的高 AUC (0.6957 vs cont 0.6114) 是 mode-specific signal amplification，不能作为泛化性证据\n- mvp-001 (Qwen-rewrite) 定位为 \"pilot study demonstrating feasibility\"，后续用 continuation mode rigorously validate\n- cont→rw 89% vs rw→cont 82% 不对称性 → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n\n## Core Claims (2+1 结构, updated D049/D050)\n\n### Primary: C1' (K* Characterization — Domain-Dependent Bounded Saturation)\n首次系统测量递归合成文本的 generational discrimination boundary K*，demonstrating that K* is low-bounded (≤3) and domain-dependent。\n\nDPI 理论证明有限 K*_theory 必然存在（信息论 impossibility boundary）；我们首次在受控实验中测量 K*_empirical，它提供 K*_theory 的保守下界。通过 8 model configurations（5 architecture families, 1B-8B）、3 source domains（C4, Wikipedia, arXiv）、4 decoding strategies 系统表征 K*_empirical 的行为，发现：\n\n- **K*∈{1,2,3} at θ=0.60**：K* 是有界的且域依赖的，呈现三级域阶梯：Wikipedia(1) < C4(2) < arXiv(3)\n- **Web text K*=2 是 dominant mode**（7/8 configurations），展现跨模型架构、跨解码策略的一致性\n- **Structured academic text (arXiv) K*=3**，经五个模型配置、四个架构族 cross-validate（Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-7B, Pythia-1.4B, LLaMA-8B, Mistral-7B; 5/5 domain-competent models, 100%）\n- **Wikipedia K*=1 (scorer-controlled)**：全部 6 个模型在 cross-family scorer 控制后均 K*=1。Qwen 生成器在 same-family scorer 下的 K*=2 是 scorer family bias artifact（D060 确认），正文报告 scorer-controlled 值，Appendix 披露 confound 细节\n- **Mistral-7B K*=1 on C4 but K*=3 on arXiv**：domain-specific one-wash，最强 domain dependence 证据\n- **Domain 是 K* 的唯一主导因素**：scorer control 后，model scale/architecture/decoding strategy 均不改变域内 K* 一致性\n- **One-wash laundering effect**：对 web text 和 Wikipedia，单次生成即令文本与更深层合成内容不可区分\n\n**子组件：**\n\n**(a) K*=2 as dominant mode for web text (7/8 configurations)**\n> **7/8 model configurations yield K*=2 on C4 web text：**\n>\n> | Model | Experiment | AUC 1v2 | 95% CI | CI lower > 0.60? |\n> |-------|-----------|---------|--------|-----------------|\n> | Qwen-1.5B-Instruct rewrite | mvp-001 | 0.6957 | [0.6859, 0.7041] | ✅ (+8.6pp) |\n> | Pythia-1.4B cont | exp-001 | 0.6539 | [0.6454, 0.6630] | ✅ (+4.5pp) |\n> | Qwen-1.5B base cont | exp-016 | 0.6262 | [0.6168, 0.6353] | ✅ (+1.7pp) |\n> | Qwen2.5-7B cont | exp-004 | 0.6178 | [0.6079, 0.6261] | ✅ (+0.79pp) |\n> | OLMo-1B cont | exp-002 | 0.6145 | [0.6045, 0.6247] | ✅ (+0.45pp) |\n> | LLaMA-3.1-8B cont | exp-018 | 0.6123 | [0.6028, 0.6216] | ✅ (+0.28pp) |\n> | Qwen-1.5B-Instruct cont | exp-017 | 0.6112 | [0.6015, 0.6213] | ✅ (+0.15pp) |\n>\n> *Exception: Mistral-7B cont (exp-019): 1v2=0.5935, CI [0.5835, 0.6032], K*=1*\n>\n> *Decoding strategy invariance (exp-003):*\n> | Decoding | AUC 1v2 | K* |\n> |----------|---------|-----|\n> | greedy | 0.6893 | 2 |\n> | nucleus p=0.9 | 0.6866 | 2 |\n> | temp=0.7 | 0.6887 | 2 |\n> | temp=1.2 | 0.7039 | 2 |\n>\n> - 7/8 configurations 1v2 CI lower > 0.60, 全部 2v3 CI upper < 0.60\n> - 4 decoding strategies AUC 1v2 range [0.6866, 0.7039], K* 完全不变\n> - ⚠️ Qwen-cont 1v2 CI lower=0.6015 极边缘；cross-scorer validation 下降至 K*=1\n> - ⚠️ θ-sensitivity: θ=0.60 下 7/8 K*=2; θ=0.70 下多数降至 K*=1\n> - Paper 措辞：\"K*=2 emerges as the dominant mode for general web text (7/8 model configurations), demonstrating consistency across diverse architectures and decoding strategies.\"\n\n**(b) Domain dependence: arXiv K*=3 (5-model cross-validated, D055/D056/D057)**\n> - **Qwen-1.5B on arXiv** (exp-024): 2v3 AUC=0.6427, CI [0.6275, 0.6575], K*=3 ✅ (+2.75pp)\n> - **Pythia-1.4B on arXiv** (exp-025): 2v3 AUC=0.6544, CI [0.6401, 0.6688], K*=3 ✅ (+4.01pp)\n> - **LLaMA-3.1-8B on arXiv** (exp_arXiv_llama8b): 2v3 AUC=0.6215, K*=3 ✅ (+2.15pp)\n> - **Mistral-7B on arXiv** (exp_arXiv_mistral7b): 2v3 AUC=0.6275, all folds > 0.60, K*=3 ✅ (+2.75pp)\n> - **Qwen-7B on arXiv** (exp_arXiv_qwen7b): 2v3 AUC=0.6255, all folds > 0.60, K*=3 ✅ (+2.55pp)\n> - 五个模型配置、四个架构族（1.4B-8B）在 arXiv 上 100% 一致 K*=3（5/5 domain-competent models，仅 OLMo capacity failure）\n> - OLMo-1B K*=1 (exp_arXiv_olmo): capacity failure — 生成完全出域文本，不影响 domain property claim，作为 \"domain competence prerequisite\" 分析放 Appendix\n> - **Mistral C4 K*=1 → arXiv K*=3 是 domain dependence 的最强证据**：同一模型在不同域给出不同 K*，证明 K* 由 domain structure 主导而非 model identity\n> - **解释**：arXiv 的结构化特征（LaTeX formatting, citation patterns, mathematical notation）提供额外 depth-distinguishing signal，使辨别力多延伸一代\n> - Sample size: n=2,200 per model\n> - ⚠️ LLaMA fold 0=0.5969 < θ, bootstrap CI lower 可能接近 0.60 边界。论文措辞用 \"K*=3 with boundary pair AUC of 0.62\" 而非 \"robustly K*=3\"\n> - 论文定位：**domain dependence 是核心发现**——K* 由源文本结构复杂度决定，非纯模型属性。4-model cross-validation 大幅强化证据链\n\n**(c) Mistral K*=1 on web text: domain-specific one-wash (D056)**\n> - Mistral-7B 在 C4 web text 上 1v2 AUC CI lower < 0.60, K*=1\n> - Cross-scorer validation (exp-022): 使用其他模型 score Mistral 生成的文本，K*=1 maintained → C4 上的 K*=1 是 text-intrinsic（非 scorer artifact）\n> - **但 Mistral arXiv K*=3 (exp_arXiv_mistral7b) 证明 one-wash 是 domain-specific 而非 model-intrinsic**\n> - **One-wash laundering**：对 web text 这类 homogeneous 域，Mistral 单次生成即令文本在统计上不可区分于更深层合成；但 structured domains (arXiv) 能 rescue even Mistral from one-wash\n> - 论文定位：Mistral C4→arXiv 的 K* 跃变（1→3）是 (model × domain) interaction 的典型案例，进一步证明 domain structure 是 K* 的主要决定因素\n\n**(d) Cross-model transfer (scorer invariance)**\n> - Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention → K* 不是 model self-familiarity artifact\n> - 0v1 AUC > 0.96 across all transfer pairs → binary contamination signal 完全跨模型可迁移\n> - Cross-scorer validation (exp-022): 11/12 generator×scorer combos yield K*=2 → K* governed by generation process, not scoring model\n> - Feature ordering: scorer-invariant Spearman ρ > 0.90\n> - 论文定位：confirms K* is a property of the text/generation process, not the measurement apparatus\n\n**(e) Representation dependence of K* (Neural Probe)**\n> - exp-015 完整 3 模型结果（frozen self-embeddings + MLP probe）:\n>   - Qwen-cont: K*(neural)=3, 2v3 AUC=0.6159, CI [0.6099, 0.6223], CI lower > 0.60 ✅\n>   - Pythia-1.4B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5963, CI [0.5892, 0.6033], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n>   - OLMo-1B: K*(neural)=2, 2v3 AUC=0.5892, CI [0.5818, 0.5965], CI lower < 0.60 ❌\n> - K*(neural) 是 model-dependent：Qwen K*=3, Pythia/OLMo K*=2\n> - 15D model-free features 给出一致的 K* across all models，neural probe 给出 model-dependent K*\n> - Interpretability-deployability tradeoff: model-free features 的 universality 优势在 cross-model 结果下更明显\n> - 论文定位：validates choice of model-free 15D features for headline characterization\n\n**(f) Generation mode analysis (§4.x Analysis subsection)**\n> - Signal strength: rewrite AUC 1v2=0.6957 vs continuation 0.6114（Δ=+8.4pp）\n> - Transferability: continuation 80-92% retention vs rewrite 61-63%\n> - Feature subset: cont→rw 89% > rw→cont 82% → continuation features 是 rewrite 的通用子集\n> - Interpretation: rewrite mode 的 instruction-following 引入 mode-specific style artifacts，放大 depth signal 但降低跨模型泛化性\n> - 论文定位：Analysis subsection，不是独立 claim\n\n### Secondary: C3 (K*-Aware Data Curation Validation)\nDomain-appropriate K* correctly predicts optimal curation granularity: for web text (K*=2), binary K*-aware filtering (0.5941 MMLU) outperforms graduated depth weighting (best 0.5892 at α=0.9), surprisal-based selection (0.5894), and DSIR distribution matching (~0.5867, ≈ no-filter level). Dose-response analysis (exp-009 v3, 3 ratios × 3 strategies × 5 seeds) confirms binary filtering maintains consistent advantage across 10%/30%/50% contamination ratios (HellaSwag significantly better at all levels, p≤0.004), while graduated filtering collapses to no-filter baseline performance. K* serves as an actionable curation guideline: the domain-dependent discrimination boundary directly determines the optimal filtering granularity.\n\n> ⚠️ Defensive framing constraint (D053): MMLU at 30% ratio p=0.074 不显著, 不能 claim \"universally beneficial\"。维持 \"consistent advantage\" 措辞，以 HellaSwag 显著性为主要证据。\n\n### Supporting Analysis: Canonical Condition Selection\nGeneration mode 是 depth estimation 的显著混淆变量。Methodology 段落阐述 continuation mode 作为 canonical condition 的选择及理由（不作为独立 claim）。\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: Web 数据正被多代递归合成文本污染。当前检测方法将合成文本视为 binary 类别（real vs synthetic），但质量随代际深度非线性退化——首代合成文本与四代合成文本的质量差异巨大却被忽视。\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Binary detectors (DivEye, Min-K%++) 不区分代际；model collapse 文献 (Shumailov et al., Alemohammad et al. 2024, Dohmatob et al. 2024) 描述宏观现象但不提供检测工具；data selection methods (DSIR, D4, DoReMi) 做分布匹配但不估计递归深度；Drayson et al. (2025) 将 binary MGT detection 应用于 importance resampling 以防止 model collapse，是目前最接近的工作。然而这些方法均做二值判断，**不估计文本经历了多少轮递归生成，也不量化辨别能力的饱和边界。**\n- **Our framing**: 将递归生成建模为 iterated lossy channel，从信息论（DPI）推导出 K* 的必然存在。K* 是首次系统测量的 operational quantity——它告诉数据策展者\"在什么深度以下，depth-aware curation 比 binary detection 更有价值\"。通过 8 model configurations（5 architecture families, 1B-8B）、3 source domains、4 decoding strategies 系统表征 K*，揭示其 **bounded domain-dependent** 本质：**K*∈{1,2,3}**，形成清晰的三级域阶梯——Wikipedia K*=1（6 models, scorer-controlled），C4 web text K*=2（7/8 configurations），arXiv K*=3（5/5 domain-competent models, 4 architecture families）。Domain 是 K* 的唯一主导因素：scorer confound 控制后，model identity/scale/decoding strategy 均不改变域内一致性。这一发现意味着递归生成信息丧失极快——one to two generation passes suffice to erase distinguishable depth structure（\"one-wash laundering\" effect）。Domain dependence 为数据治理提供 actionable guidance：源文本的结构复杂度决定了 depth-aware filtering 的适用粒度。\n- **Headline result template**: \"Recursive generation has a bounded discrimination boundary at K*∈{1,2,3}, forming a three-level domain hierarchy: Wikipedia saturates at K*=1 (all 6 models, scorer-controlled), web text at K*=2 (7/8 model configurations, 5 architecture families, 1B-8B), and structured academic text extends to K*=3 (cross-validated across 5 models, 4 architecture families). Domain structural complexity is the sole systematic determinant of K*. Cross-model transfer retention of 80-92% and scorer-invariant feature ordering (ρ>0.90) confirm depth features are text-intrinsic. Domain-appropriate K* correctly predicts optimal curation granularity.\"\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n\n1. **\"K*∈{1,2,3} 范围太小，结论是否 trivial？\"** → 恰好相反：K* 的低有界性是核心发现。DPI 理论只保证 K* 有限但不给上界；我们首次实证表明 K*≤3（即递归信息丧失极快），且 domain dependence 揭示了结构化文本如何延缓信息退化。One-wash laundering effect 对 data governance 有直接实践意义。\n2. **\"只基于小模型（≤8B），能推广到更大模型吗？\"** → 5 architecture families (1B-8B) 覆盖了当前开源生态的主要架构。DPI 理论保证 K*_theory 对任意规模模型存在。Cross-scorer validation 表明 K* 由生成过程而非评分模型决定。扩展至 13B+/70B+ 是重要 future work。\n3. **\"只是 feature engineering + off-the-shelf classifier，方法贡献弱\"** → 贡献在 problem formulation + empirical characterization（首次测量 K*）+ 理论框架（DPI）+ domain-dependent bounded saturation 发现，不是分类器本身。Model-free features 的选择被 cross-model transfer 80-92% 和 scorer invariance 验证为正确设计。\n4. **\"arXiv K*=3 样本量够吗？\"** → 五个模型（Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-7B, Pythia-1.4B, LLaMA-8B, Mistral-7B）跨四个架构族均给出 K*=3，每模型 n=2,200，bootstrap CI 确认统计显著。5/5 domain-competent models 100% 一致性排除 model-specific artifact。\n5. **\"Mistral K*=1 是 outlier 还是 systematic？\"** → Cross-scorer validation 确认是 text-intrinsic（非 scorer artifact）。Mistral 可能因训练数据/alignment 差异导致生成文本在一代后即失去 depth-distinguishing structure。这强化了 domain/model dependence 的核心论点。\n6. **\"Prompt-chain 不代表真实世界递归污染\"** → Prompt-chain 隔离纯文本退化效应（text-intrinsic degradation），是更 generalizable 的实验设计。**exp-008 实证验证**：retrain-chain (Pythia-1.4B LoRA) K*≥4（1v2=0.9484, 2v3=0.8888, 3v4=0.7982），远高于 prompt-chain K*=2。原因：LoRA fine-tune 每代引入累积模型 artifacts（vocabulary narrowing, repetition bias），使各代高度可区分。这些 model-adaptation artifacts 是 setup-specific 的，不泛化到 wild contamination scenarios。因此 prompt-chain K*=2 是 data curation 的 operational boundary（仅反映 text-intrinsic information loss），而非 retrain-chain 的 upper bound。\n7. **\"同模型做生成和 surprisal 计算有 bias\"** → **exp-013/exp-022 直接反驳**：cross-scorer validation 11/12 combos yield K*=2, Pythia↔OLMo 90-92% accuracy retention。K* governed by generation process, not scoring model。**D060 进一步证实**：Wikipedia 上 Qwen same-family scorer 的 +1 bias 被 Pythia cross-family scorer 消除（K*=2→1），证明 scorer confound 可被检测和控制，且仅影响特定 model-family×domain 组合（不影响 C4 主线结论）。\n8. **\"为什么不用 learned representations\"** → **exp-015 直接回应**：neural probe K* 是 model-dependent（Qwen=3, Pythia/OLMo=2），而 15D model-free features 给出一致的 K* across all models。Model-free 方案的 universality + cross-model transferability 是 practical advantage。\n9. **\"θ=0.60 选择是否 arbitrary？\"** → 三层辩护：(1) Cohen's h≈0.20 small effect size threshold, (2) permutation test 校准, (3) AUC gap 在 boundary 处的 sharp discontinuity（1v2 vs 2v3 gap 大于 θ 选择的 sensitivity range）。θ-sensitivity analysis [0.55, 0.70] 在主文呈现。\n10. **\"Graduated filtering 没和 data selection methods 比\"** → exp-006 包含 DSIR baseline + α sensitivity sweep，binary K*-aware filtering outperforms all tested alternatives。\n\n## Venue Fit\n\n- EMNLP 2026 special theme 明确呼吁 data contamination, synthetic data feedback loops, data governance 方向的工作\n- 2+1 claim 结构：C1' 是 comprehensive characterization study with domain-dependent bounded saturation finding，C3 是 practical application，generation mode analysis 增加深度\n- **Domain-dependent bounded saturation narrative** 比 universality 更准确且更有 impact：K*∈{1,2,3} 的 bounded range + domain dependence 是 nuanced scientific finding，比 \"K*=2 everywhere\" 更可信且更 interesting（审稿人不必怀疑过度外推）\n- One-wash laundering effect 是 memorable concept 便于传播\n- 风险：K* range 小（1-3）可能被认为 trivial → 论文须强调 bounded ≤3 本身是 surprising（DPI 不给上界），且 domain dependence 是 actionable（不同域需不同 curation 策略）\n","numLines":151,"startLine":1,"totalLines":151}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H6iM9o3G18RQLhpRcQm7Xe","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"exp-014 Naturalistic Validation (Common Crawl)\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"对 Common Crawl 2025-21/2026-09 snapshot 各抽 10K 文档，用训练好的 15D OBD 分类器 做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore、vocabulary richness (type-token ratio, hapax legomena ratio)、 self-BLEU 做 correlation 分析。验证 depth 预测在 wild data 上的生态效度。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"n_docs_2025\": 10000,\n7\t      \"n_docs_2026\": 10000,\n8\t      \"predicted_depth_distribution_2025\": {\n9\t        \"depth_0\": 0.72,\n10\t        \"depth_1\": 0.18,\n11\t        \"depth_2\": 0.07,\n12\t        \"depth_3_plus\": 0.03\n13\t      },\n14\t      \"predicted_depth_distribution_2026\": {\n15\t        \"depth_0\": 0.61,\n16\t        \"depth_1\": 0.24,\n17\t        \"depth_2\": 0.1,\n18\t        \"depth_3_plus\": 0.05\n19\t      },\n20\t      \"depth_vs_ttr_spearman\": -0.34,\n21\t      \"depth_vs_ttr_p\": \"<0.001\",\n22\t      \"depth_vs_hapax_ratio_spearman\": -0.29,\n23\t      \"depth_vs_hapax_ratio_p\": \"<0.001\",\n24\t      \"depth_vs_alignscore_spearman\": -0.18,\n25\t      \"depth_vs_alignscore_p\": \"<0.001\",\n26\t      \"depth_vs_self_bleu_spearman\": 0.22,\n27\t      \"depth_vs_self_bleu_p\": \"<0.001\",\n28\t      \"temporal_shift_depth1_plus_pct_delta\": \"+7.7pp\",\n29\t      \"temporal_shift_direction\": \"2026 shows higher predicted synthetic proportion\"\n30\t    },\n31\t    \"tables\": [\n32\t      {\n33\t        \"name\": \"Table: Naturalistic Correlation Analysis\",\n34\t        \"columns\": [\n35\t          \"Metric\",\n36\t          \"Spearman ρ\",\n37\t          \"p-value\",\n38\t          \"n\"\n39\t        ],\n40\t        \"rows\": [\n41\t          [\n42\t            \"Depth vs TTR\",\n43\t            \"-0.34\",\n44\t            \"<0.001\",\n45\t            \"20000\"\n46\t          ],\n47\t          [\n48\t            \"Depth vs Hapax Ratio\",\n49\t            \"-0.29\",\n50\t            \"<0.001\",\n51\t            \"20000\"\n52\t          ],\n53\t          [\n54\t            \"Depth vs AlignScore\",\n55\t            \"-0.18\",\n56\t            \"<0.001\",\n57\t            \"20000\"\n58\t          ],\n59\t          [\n60\t            \"Depth vs Self-BLEU\",\n61\t            \"+0.22\",\n62\t            \"<0.001\",\n63\t            \"20000\"\n64\t          ]\n65\t        ]\n66\t      },\n67\t      {\n68\t        \"name\": \"Table: Predicted Depth Distribution Shift\",\n69\t        \"columns\": [\n70\t          \"Snapshot\",\n71\t          \"Depth 0\",\n72\t          \"Depth 1\",\n73\t          \"Depth 2\",\n74\t          \"Depth 3+\"\n75\t        ],\n76\t        \"rows\": [\n77\t          [\n78\t            \"CC 2025-21\",\n79\t            \"72%\",\n80\t            \"18%\",\n81\t            \"7%\",\n82\t            \"3%\"\n83\t          ],\n84\t          [\n85\t            \"CC 2026-09\",\n86\t            \"61%\",\n87\t            \"24%\",\n88\t            \"10%\",\n89\t            \"5%\"\n90\t          ],\n91\t          [\n92\t            \"Δ\",\n93\t            \"-11pp\",\n94\t            \"+6pp\",\n95\t            \"+3pp\",\n96\t            \"+2pp\"\n97\t          ]\n98\t        ]\n99\t      }\n100\t    ],\n101\t    \"figures\": [],\n102\t    \"analysis\": \"Naturalistic validation 确认 depth 预测在 wild data 上与独立 lexical diversity 指标方向一致， 中等效应量（|ρ|=0.18-0.34）在 20K 样本上高度显著。这些相关性不依赖于我们的 15D feature set 的 任何特定特征，而是与外部指标的独立验证。时间趋势提供了额外的 face validity。论文定位为  Appendix 支持材料，不作为主线 claim 的基础，但回应了 \\\"lab-controlled setup 是否泛化\\\" 的审稿人关切。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下：(1) depth 预测与 vocabulary richness 指标（TTR, hapax ratio）呈中等负相关 （ρ≈-0.29 to -0.34），因为递归生成导致 vocabulary narrowing 是已知效应（Shumailov et al. 2023）， 15D features 中的 freq_entropy 本身就捕获了这个信号，所以 depth 预测与独立 lexical diversity  指标的一致性是预期的。(2) AlignScore 相关性较弱（ρ≈-0.18），因为 AlignScore 测量的是事实一致性 而非生成深度，两者仅部分重叠——深层合成文本的事实性下降但 AlignScore 的设计目标不同。 (3) Self-BLEU 正相关（ρ≈0.22），因为递归生成增加重复性。(4) 2025→2026 时间趋势显示 合成文本占比上升约 7.7pp，与 2024-2025 年间 LLM 生成内容在 web 上指数增长的趋势一致。 相关性为中等强度而非强相关，因为 wild data 含有大量混淆因素（topic, length, author style）， 但方向一致性和统计显著性足以作为 naturalistic validation。\\n\"\n103\t  },\n104\t  {\n105\t    \"name\": \"exp-028 Subsampling Power Curve\",\n106\t    \"description\": \"从 exp-007 的 C4 数据中，以 n={1000, 2000, 3000, 4000, 5000} 五个样本量、每个做  10 次随机 resampling，计算每次 resample 下的 1v2 AUC 及其 bootstrap CI，确定 K*=2  判定所需最低样本量。\\n\",\n107\t    \"results\": {\n108\t      \"sample_sizes\": [\n109\t        1000,\n110\t        2000,\n111\t        3000,\n112\t        4000,\n113\t        5000\n114\t      ],\n115\t      \"resamples_per_size\": 10,\n116\t      \"fraction_kstar_2\": {\n117\t        \"n1000\": 0.6,\n118\t        \"n2000\": 0.9,\n119\t        \"n3000\": 1.0,\n120\t        \"n4000\": 1.0,\n121\t        \"n5000\": 1.0\n122\t      },\n123\t      \"mean_1v2_auc\": {\n124\t        \"n1000\": 0.612,\n125\t        \"n2000\": 0.617,\n126\t        \"n3000\": 0.62,\n127\t        \"n4000\": 0.622,\n128\t        \"n5000\": 0.624\n129\t      },\n130\t      \"mean_ci_width\": {\n131\t        \"n1000\": 0.038,\n132\t        \"n2000\": 0.027,\n133\t        \"n3000\": 0.022,\n134\t        \"n4000\": 0.019,\n135\t        \"n5000\": 0.017\n136\t      },\n137\t      \"min_n_for_robust_kstar2\": 2000,\n138\t      \"mean_1v2_ci_lower\": {\n139\t        \"n1000\": 0.593,\n140\t        \"n2000\": 0.604,\n141\t        \"n3000\": 0.609,\n142\t        \"n4000\": 0.613,\n143\t        \"n5000\": 0.616\n144\t      }\n145\t    },\n146\t    \"tables\": [\n147\t      {\n148\t        \"name\": \"Table: K*=2 Determination Stability by Sample Size\",\n149\t        \"columns\": [\n150\t          \"n\",\n151\t          \"K*=2 fraction\",\n152\t          \"Mean 1v2 AUC\",\n153\t          \"Mean CI lower\",\n154\t          \"Mean CI width\"\n155\t        ],\n156\t        \"rows\": [\n157\t          [\n158\t            \"1,000\",\n159\t            \"6/10\",\n160\t            \"0.612\",\n161\t            \"0.593\",\n162\t            \"0.038\"\n163\t          ],\n164\t          [\n165\t            \"2,000\",\n166\t            \"9/10\",\n167\t            \"0.617\",\n168\t            \"0.604\",\n169\t            \"0.027\"\n170\t          ],\n171\t          [\n172\t            \"3,000\",\n173\t            \"10/10\",\n174\t            \"0.620\",\n175\t            \"0.609\",\n176\t            \"0.022\"\n177\t          ],\n178\t          [\n179\t            \"4,000\",\n180\t            \"10/10\",\n181\t            \"0.622\",\n182\t            \"0.613\",\n183\t            \"0.019\"\n184\t          ],\n185\t          [\n186\t            \"5,000\",\n187\t            \"10/10\",\n188\t            \"0.624\",\n189\t            \"0.616\",\n190\t            \"0.017\"\n191\t          ]\n192\t        ]\n193\t      }\n194\t    ],\n195\t    \"figures\": [],\n196\t    \"analysis\": \"Power analysis 证明 n=2000 是 K*=2 判定的 practical minimum（90% 稳定）， n=3000 给出完全稳定性。论文的 n=5000 per condition 远超需求， 为 Reviewer m4 的样本量关切提供定量回应。放 Appendix 作为 robustness check。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下：(1) n=1000 时 CI width≈0.038，1v2 AUC 点估计约 0.612 但 CI lower 经常 落到 0.593（< θ=0.60），导致仅 60% 的 resamples 判定 K*=2——统计功效不足。 (2) n=2000 时 CI width 缩至约 0.027，mean CI lower 升至 0.604，90% resamples 给出 K*=2。 这是因为 1v2 效应量本身较小（AUC≈0.62，对应 Cohen's d≈0.20），需要足够样本量才能 让 CI 不跨越 θ=0.60 阈值。(3) n≥3000 后 100% resamples 均判定 K*=2，因为 CI width 缩至 0.022 以下，即使最不利的 resample 其 CI lower 也在 0.609 以上。 (4) 点估计随 n 增加轻微上升（0.612→0.624），这是小样本负偏的纠正效应。 结论：n=2000 是 robust K*=2 判定的 practical minimum，但 n=3000 提供 100% 稳定性。 论文的 n=5000 设计远超 minimum required，充分回应了审稿人关于样本量的关切。\\n\"\n197\t  },\n198\t  {\n199\t    \"name\": \"exp_32b_c4 Qwen2.5-32B Cross-Scale (RUNNING)\",\n200\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-32B continuation mode, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。 最大规模模型验证 K*=2 的 scale invariance。\\n\",\n201\t    \"results\": {\n202\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n203\t      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n204\t        \"0v1\": 0.9515,\n205\t        \"1v2\": 0.6185,\n206\t        \"2v3\": 0.5465,\n207\t        \"3v4\": 0.5215,\n208\t        \"4v5\": 0.5125\n209\t      },\n210\t      \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n211\t        \"0v1\": 0.0985,\n212\t        \"1v2\": 0.0108,\n213\t        \"2v3\": 0.0058,\n214\t        \"3v4\": 0.0041,\n215\t        \"4v5\": 0.0033\n216\t      },\n217\t      \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n218\t        \"0v1\": {\n219\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.9478,\n220\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.9552\n221\t        },\n222\t        \"1v2\": {\n223\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.6092,\n224\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.6278\n225\t        },\n226\t        \"2v3\": {\n227\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.5363,\n228\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.5567\n229\t        },\n230\t        \"3v4\": {\n231\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.5112,\n232\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.5318\n233\t        },\n234\t        \"4v5\": {\n235\t          \"ci_lower\": 0.5018,\n236\t          \"ci_upper\": 0.5232\n237\t        }\n238\t      },\n239\t      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.235,\n240\t      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.348,\n241\t      \"top_features\": [\n242\t        \"freq_entropy\",\n243\t        \"surp_d1_skew\",\n244\t        \"surp_std\"\n245\t      ]\n246\t    },\n247\t    \"tables\": [\n248\t      {\n249\t        \"name\": \"Table: Scale Invariance Summary (C4, continuation, θ=0.60)\",\n250\t        \"columns\": [\n251\t          \"Model\",\n252\t          \"Scale\",\n253\t          \"K*\",\n254\t          \"1v2 AUC\",\n255\t          \"1v2 CI lower\"\n256\t        ],\n257\t        \"rows\": [\n258\t          [\n259\t            \"OLMo\",\n260\t            \"1B\",\n261\t            \"2\",\n262\t            \"0.6145\",\n263\t            \"0.6045\"\n264\t          ],\n265\t          [\n266\t            \"Pythia\",\n267\t            \"1.4B\",\n268\t            \"2\",\n269\t            \"0.6539\",\n270\t            \"0.6454\"\n271\t          ],\n272\t          [\n273\t            \"Qwen-base\",\n274\t            \"1.5B\",\n275\t            \"2\",\n276\t            \"0.6262\",\n277\t            \"0.6168\"\n278\t          ],\n279\t          [\n280\t            \"Qwen-instruct\",\n281\t            \"1.5B\",\n282\t            \"2\",\n283\t            \"0.6112\",\n284\t            \"0.6015\"\n285\t          ],\n286\t          [\n287\t            \"Qwen\",\n288\t            \"7B\",\n289\t            \"2\",\n290\t            \"0.6178\",\n291\t            \"0.6079\"\n292\t          ],\n293\t          [\n294\t            \"LLaMA-3.1\",\n295\t            \"8B\",\n296\t            \"2\",\n297\t            \"0.6123\",\n298\t            \"0.6028\"\n299\t          ],\n300\t          [\n301\t            \"Qwen\",\n302\t            \"14B\",\n303\t            \"2\",\n304\t            \"0.6210\",\n305\t            \"0.6119\"\n306\t          ],\n307\t          [\n308\t            \"Qwen\",\n309\t            \"32B\",\n310\t            \"2\",\n311\t            \"0.6185\",\n312\t            \"0.6092\"\n313\t          ]\n314\t        ]\n315\t      }\n316\t    ],\n317\t    \"figures\": [],\n318\t    \"analysis\": \"32B 结果将 scale invariance 证据从 ≤8B 扩展至 ≤32B，覆盖 32x 的规模范围。 K*=2 在所有 8 个 C4 web text 配置（含 Mistral K*=1 例外）上保持一致。 论文 limitation 从 \\\"≤8B\\\" 改为 \\\"≤32B\\\"，并保留 \\\"extending to 70B+ is future work\\\"  的措辞。审稿人关于规模局限性的关切从 moderate concern 降为 minor concern。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下：(1) K*=2 在 32B 模型上得到确认，1v2 CI lower=0.6092 > θ=0.60。 这延续了 1.5B→7B→14B→32B 的 scale invariance 趋势。(2) 0v1 AUC 略低于小模型 （0.9515 vs Qwen-1.5B 0.987），因为更大模型生成的文本更接近人类分布， binary 信号稍弱但仍远超阈值。(3) 1v2 AUC (0.6185) 与 14B (0.621) 和 7B (0.618)  非常接近，证明 depth discrimination boundary 不随模型规模单调变化——DPI 理论预测 K* 由信息损失率决定而非模型容量。(4) JSD 和特征排序与小模型一致 （freq_entropy 和 surp_d1_skew 仍为 top discriminators），进一步支持  K* 是文本固有属性而非模型属性的核心论点。(5) 32B 是论文中最大的模型， 虽仍属 ≤32B 范围（不覆盖 70B+），但已将 scale invariance 证据链从 \\\"≤8B\\\"  扩展至 \\\"≤32B\\\"，显著缓解审稿人关于模型规模局限性的关切。\\n\"\n319\t  },\n320\t  {\n321\t    \"name\": \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated (what_if: honest negative)\",\n322\t    \"description\": \"将 exp-026 arXiv graduated filtering 的负向结果整合入论文：Section 5 增加 arXiv null result  table，Discussion 增加 \\\"K* characterizes signal discriminability, not data utility\\\" 洞察。 评估 honest negative 对审稿分数和论文可信度的影响。\\n\",\n323\t    \"results\": {\n324\t      \"section5_arXiv_null_table\": {\n325\t        \"strategies\": [\n326\t          \"no_filter\",\n327\t          \"binary\",\n328\t          \"graduated_α0.9\"\n329\t        ],\n330\t        \"mmlu\": {\n331\t          \"no_filter\": \"0.5899±0.0008\",\n332\t          \"binary\": \"0.5876±0.0004\",\n333\t          \"graduated\": \"0.5900±0.0011\"\n334\t        },\n335\t        \"hellaswag\": {\n336\t          \"no_filter\": \"0.6600±0.0002\",\n337\t          \"binary\": \"0.6642±0.0004\",\n338\t          \"graduated\": \"0.6599±0.0003\"\n339\t        },\n340\t        \"paired_ttest_graduated_vs_nofilter\": {\n341\t          \"mmlu_p\": 0.89,\n342\t          \"hellaswag_p\": 0.71\n343\t        },\n344\t        \"verdict\": \"graduated ≈ no_filter (all p > 0.24)\"\n345\t      },\n346\t      \"exp025_pythia_null_appendix\": {\n347\t        \"delta_max\": 0.0017,\n348\t        \"verdict\": \"all strategies within noise\"\n349\t      },\n350\t      \"discussion_insight\": \"K* characterizes the information-theoretic boundary of depth signal  discriminability, not the boundary of training data utility. Depth 2-3  arXiv text is statistically distinguishable (K*=3) but removing it does  not improve downstream performance — the discriminable signal does not  correspond to quality degradation at these depths.\\n\",\n351\t      \"credibility_boost_estimated\": 0.75,\n352\t      \"reviewer_response_predicted\": {\n353\t        \"positive_framing\": \"\\\"The authors commendably report negative results on graduated filtering  (exp-026) and cross-model filtering (exp-025), providing a nuanced picture  that strengthens the paper's scientific contribution.\\\"\\n\",\n354\t        \"c3_acceptance_shift\": \"+0.10 (from 0.70 to 0.80)\",\n355\t        \"soundness_boost\": \"+0.25 (honest methodology)\"\n356\t      },\n357\t      \"impact_on_scores\": {\n358\t        \"avg_reviewer_score_delta\": \"+0.15\",\n359\t        \"soundness_delta\": \"+0.25\",\n360\t        \"substance_delta\": \"+0.10\",\n361\t        \"venue_acceptance_prob_delta\": \"+0.05\"\n362\t      }\n363\t    },\n364\t    \"tables\": [\n365\t      {\n366\t        \"name\": \"Table (Section 5): arXiv Domain Filtering — Null Result\",\n367\t        \"columns\": [\n368\t          \"Strategy\",\n369\t          \"MMLU\",\n370\t          \"HellaSwag\",\n371\t          \"Δ MMLU vs no-filter\",\n372\t          \"Δ HellaSwag vs no-filter\"\n373\t        ],\n374\t        \"rows\": [\n375\t          [\n376\t            \"No filter\",\n377\t            \"0.5899±0.0008\",\n378\t            \"0.6600±0.0002\",\n379\t            \"—\",\n380\t            \"—\"\n381\t          ],\n382\t          [\n383\t            \"Binary (K*-aware)\",\n384\t            \"0.5876±0.0004\",\n385\t            \"0.6642±0.0004\",\n386\t            \"-0.0023*\",\n387\t            \"+0.0042***\"\n388\t          ],\n389\t          [\n390\t            \"Graduated (α=0.9)\",\n391\t            \"0.5900±0.0011\",\n392\t            \"0.6599±0.0003\",\n393\t            \"+0.0001\",\n394\t            \"-0.0001\"\n395\t          ]\n396\t        ],\n397\t        \"footnotes\": [\n398\t          \"* p=0.005 (paired t-test, 5 seeds); *** p<0.00001\",\n399\t          \"Graduated ≈ no-filter on both metrics (MMLU p=0.89, HellaSwag p=0.71)\"\n400\t        ]\n401\t      },\n402\t      {\n403\t        \"name\": \"Table (Appendix): Pythia-1.4B Filtering — Model-Scale Sensitivity\",\n404\t        \"columns\": [\n405\t          \"Strategy\",\n406\t          \"MMLU\",\n407\t          \"HellaSwag\"\n408\t        ],\n409\t        \"rows\": [\n410\t          [\n411\t            \"No filter\",\n412\t            \"0.2568±0.0012\",\n413\t            \"0.5250±0.0008\"\n414\t          ],\n415\t          [\n416\t            \"Binary\",\n417\t            \"0.2585±0.0004\",\n418\t            \"0.5251±0.0001\"\n419\t          ],\n420\t          [\n421\t            \"Graduated (α=0.9)\",\n422\t            \"0.2561±0.0009\",\n423\t            \"0.5253±0.0007\"\n424\t          ]\n425\t        ],\n426\t        \"footnotes\": [\n427\t          \"All deltas within noise (max Δ=0.0017). Pythia-1.4B MMLU baseline near random (0.257), suggesting model capacity floor masks filtering effects.\"\n428\t        ]\n429\t      }\n430\t    ],\n431\t    \"figures\": [],\n432\t    \"analysis\": \"Honest negative integration 是 best 档的关键差异化因素。审稿人在 best 档下不仅 不惩罚负向结果，反而给予可信度加分。核心机制：(1) C3 claim 的精确化——从  over-broad \\\"K* predicts optimal curation\\\" 到 nuanced \\\"K* predicts discriminability  boundary; curation utility depends on domain-specific quality-depth coupling\\\"； (2) 概念贡献的增加——\\\"K* ≠ data utility\\\" 成为 Discussion 的独立贡献点； (3) 论文完整性——读者不需要猜测 \\\"graduated filtering 在其他域是否有效\\\"， 因为论文已经系统测试并报告了答案。这种透明度在 EMNLP 审稿文化中尤其受重视。\\n\\nBest 档下，honest negatives 产生显著的可信度提升效应： (1) exp-026 arXiv null result 被审稿人视为负责任的科学态度。在 ML 领域，报告负向结果 仍然稀缺，这种做法本身就是差异化信号。审稿人对 C3 的接受度从 0.70 升至 0.80， 因为 C3 的 claim 从 \\\"graduated filtering is universally better\\\" 调整为更精确的  \\\"binary K*-aware filtering is the appropriate granularity for web text (K*=2);  on domains with higher K* (arXiv, K*=3), the additional depth information  does not translate to downstream utility gains\\\"——这是一个更有 nuance 也更可信的叙事。 (2) Discussion 中的 \\\"K* ≠ data utility\\\" 洞察被审稿人视为 conceptual contribution， 因为它区分了信息论意义上的可区分性和实际训练价值——这是一个非显然但重要的观察， 为 K* 的理论定位提供了更精确的边界。(3) exp-025 Pythia null 放 Appendix 作为  model-scale sensitivity 分析，审稿人注意到但不视为主线缺陷，因为 Pythia-1.4B  在 MMLU 上的 base performance (0.2568) 本身就接近 random，filtering 效果被  model capacity floor 掩盖是合理的解释。(4) 综合影响：honest negatives 将论文 从 \\\"we prove everything works\\\" 的可疑叙事转为 \\\"we carefully characterize what works  and what doesn't\\\"，这在 characterization study 的定位下尤其有效。预估 soundness  提升 0.25 分（从 3.5-4.0 范围的下端移向上端），整体接收概率提升约 5pp。\\n\"\n433\t  }\n434\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"77007605-4c46-46a1-9837-c424a2ae6462","uuid":"47f7e338-2109-4309-a4ee-1d1771e1d346","timestamp":"2026-05-18T13:15:46.327Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T125757/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-014 Naturalistic Validation (Common Crawl)\",\n    \"description\": \"对 Common Crawl 2025-21/2026-09 snapshot 各抽 10K 文档，用训练好的 15D OBD 分类器 做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore、vocabulary richness (type-token ratio, hapax legomena ratio)、 self-BLEU 做 correlation 分析。验证 depth 预测在 wild data 上的生态效度。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_docs_2025\": 10000,\n      \"n_docs_2026\": 10000,\n      \"predicted_depth_distribution_2025\": {\n        \"depth_0\": 0.72,\n        \"depth_1\": 0.18,\n        \"depth_2\": 0.07,\n        \"depth_3_plus\": 0.03\n      },\n      \"predicted_depth_distribution_2026\": {\n        \"depth_0\": 0.61,\n        \"depth_1\": 0.24,\n        \"depth_2\": 0.1,\n        \"depth_3_plus\": 0.05\n      },\n      \"depth_vs_ttr_spearman\": -0.34,\n      \"depth_vs_ttr_p\": \"<0.001\",\n      \"depth_vs_hapax_ratio_spearman\": -0.29,\n      \"depth_vs_hapax_ratio_p\": \"<0.001\",\n      \"depth_vs_alignscore_spearman\": -0.18,\n      \"depth_vs_alignscore_p\": \"<0.001\",\n      \"depth_vs_self_bleu_spearman\": 0.22,\n      \"depth_vs_self_bleu_p\": \"<0.001\",\n      \"temporal_shift_depth1_plus_pct_delta\": \"+7.7pp\",\n      \"temporal_shift_direction\": \"2026 shows higher predicted synthetic proportion\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Naturalistic Correlation Analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Spearman ρ\",\n          \"p-value\",\n          \"n\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Depth vs TTR\",\n            \"-0.34\",\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"20000\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Depth vs Hapax Ratio\",\n            \"-0.29\",\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"20000\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Depth vs AlignScore\",\n            \"-0.18\",\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"20000\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Depth vs Self-BLEU\",\n            \"+0.22\",\n            \"<0.001\",\n            \"20000\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Predicted Depth Distribution Shift\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Snapshot\",\n          \"Depth 0\",\n          \"Depth 1\",\n          \"Depth 2\",\n          \"Depth 3+\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"CC 2025-21\",\n            \"72%\",\n            \"18%\",\n            \"7%\",\n            \"3%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CC 2026-09\",\n            \"61%\",\n            \"24%\",\n            \"10%\",\n            \"5%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Δ\",\n            \"-11pp\",\n            \"+6pp\",\n            \"+3pp\",\n            \"+2pp\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Naturalistic validation 确认 depth 预测在 wild data 上与独立 lexical diversity 指标方向一致， 中等效应量（|ρ|=0.18-0.34）在 20K 样本上高度显著。这些相关性不依赖于我们的 15D feature set 的 任何特定特征，而是与外部指标的独立验证。时间趋势提供了额外的 face validity。论文定位为  Appendix 支持材料，不作为主线 claim 的基础，但回应了 \\\"lab-controlled setup 是否泛化\\\" 的审稿人关切。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下：(1) depth 预测与 vocabulary richness 指标（TTR, hapax ratio）呈中等负相关 （ρ≈-0.29 to -0.34），因为递归生成导致 vocabulary narrowing 是已知效应（Shumailov et al. 2023）， 15D features 中的 freq_entropy 本身就捕获了这个信号，所以 depth 预测与独立 lexical diversity  指标的一致性是预期的。(2) AlignScore 相关性较弱（ρ≈-0.18），因为 AlignScore 测量的是事实一致性 而非生成深度，两者仅部分重叠——深层合成文本的事实性下降但 AlignScore 的设计目标不同。 (3) Self-BLEU 正相关（ρ≈0.22），因为递归生成增加重复性。(4) 2025→2026 时间趋势显示 合成文本占比上升约 7.7pp，与 2024-2025 年间 LLM 生成内容在 web 上指数增长的趋势一致。 相关性为中等强度而非强相关，因为 wild data 含有大量混淆因素（topic, length, author style）， 但方向一致性和统计显著性足以作为 naturalistic validation。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-028 Subsampling Power Curve\",\n    \"description\": \"从 exp-007 的 C4 数据中，以 n={1000, 2000, 3000, 4000, 5000} 五个样本量、每个做  10 次随机 resampling，计算每次 resample 下的 1v2 AUC 及其 bootstrap CI，确定 K*=2  判定所需最低样本量。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sample_sizes\": [\n        1000,\n        2000,\n        3000,\n        4000,\n        5000\n      ],\n      \"resamples_per_size\": 10,\n      \"fraction_kstar_2\": {\n        \"n1000\": 0.6,\n        \"n2000\": 0.9,\n        \"n3000\": 1.0,\n        \"n4000\": 1.0,\n        \"n5000\": 1.0\n      },\n      \"mean_1v2_auc\": {\n        \"n1000\": 0.612,\n        \"n2000\": 0.617,\n        \"n3000\": 0.62,\n        \"n4000\": 0.622,\n        \"n5000\": 0.624\n      },\n      \"mean_ci_width\": {\n        \"n1000\": 0.038,\n        \"n2000\": 0.027,\n        \"n3000\": 0.022,\n        \"n4000\": 0.019,\n        \"n5000\": 0.017\n      },\n      \"min_n_for_robust_kstar2\": 2000,\n      \"mean_1v2_ci_lower\": {\n        \"n1000\": 0.593,\n        \"n2000\": 0.604,\n        \"n3000\": 0.609,\n        \"n4000\": 0.613,\n        \"n5000\": 0.616\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: K*=2 Determination Stability by Sample Size\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"n\",\n          \"K*=2 fraction\",\n          \"Mean 1v2 AUC\",\n          \"Mean CI lower\",\n          \"Mean CI width\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"1,000\",\n            \"6/10\",\n            \"0.612\",\n            \"0.593\",\n            \"0.038\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2,000\",\n            \"9/10\",\n            \"0.617\",\n            \"0.604\",\n            \"0.027\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3,000\",\n            \"10/10\",\n            \"0.620\",\n            \"0.609\",\n            \"0.022\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4,000\",\n            \"10/10\",\n            \"0.622\",\n            \"0.613\",\n            \"0.019\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"5,000\",\n            \"10/10\",\n            \"0.624\",\n            \"0.616\",\n            \"0.017\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Power analysis 证明 n=2000 是 K*=2 判定的 practical minimum（90% 稳定）， n=3000 给出完全稳定性。论文的 n=5000 per condition 远超需求， 为 Reviewer m4 的样本量关切提供定量回应。放 Appendix 作为 robustness check。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下：(1) n=1000 时 CI width≈0.038，1v2 AUC 点估计约 0.612 但 CI lower 经常 落到 0.593（< θ=0.60），导致仅 60% 的 resamples 判定 K*=2——统计功效不足。 (2) n=2000 时 CI width 缩至约 0.027，mean CI lower 升至 0.604，90% resamples 给出 K*=2。 这是因为 1v2 效应量本身较小（AUC≈0.62，对应 Cohen's d≈0.20），需要足够样本量才能 让 CI 不跨越 θ=0.60 阈值。(3) n≥3000 后 100% resamples 均判定 K*=2，因为 CI width 缩至 0.022 以下，即使最不利的 resample 其 CI lower 也在 0.609 以上。 (4) 点估计随 n 增加轻微上升（0.612→0.624），这是小样本负偏的纠正效应。 结论：n=2000 是 robust K*=2 判定的 practical minimum，但 n=3000 提供 100% 稳定性。 论文的 n=5000 设计远超 minimum required，充分回应了审稿人关于样本量的关切。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp_32b_c4 Qwen2.5-32B Cross-Scale (RUNNING)\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-32B continuation mode, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。 最大规模模型验证 K*=2 的 scale invariance。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.9515,\n        \"1v2\": 0.6185,\n        \"2v3\": 0.5465,\n        \"3v4\": 0.5215,\n        \"4v5\": 0.5125\n      },\n      \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.0985,\n        \"1v2\": 0.0108,\n        \"2v3\": 0.0058,\n        \"3v4\": 0.0041,\n        \"4v5\": 0.0033\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_ci\": {\n        \"0v1\": {\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.9478,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.9552\n        },\n        \"1v2\": {\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.6092,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.6278\n        },\n        \"2v3\": {\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5363,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5567\n        },\n        \"3v4\": {\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5112,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5318\n        },\n        \"4v5\": {\n          \"ci_lower\": 0.5018,\n          \"ci_upper\": 0.5232\n        }\n      },\n      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.235,\n      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.348,\n      \"top_features\": [\n        \"freq_entropy\",\n        \"surp_d1_skew\",\n        \"surp_std\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Scale Invariance Summary (C4, continuation, θ=0.60)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Scale\",\n          \"K*\",\n          \"1v2 AUC\",\n          \"1v2 CI lower\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"OLMo\",\n            \"1B\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"0.6145\",\n            \"0.6045\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pythia\",\n            \"1.4B\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"0.6539\",\n            \"0.6454\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-base\",\n            \"1.5B\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"0.6262\",\n            \"0.6168\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-instruct\",\n            \"1.5B\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"0.6112\",\n            \"0.6015\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen\",\n            \"7B\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"0.6178\",\n            \"0.6079\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LLaMA-3.1\",\n            \"8B\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"0.6123\",\n            \"0.6028\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen\",\n            \"14B\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"0.6210\",\n            \"0.6119\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen\",\n            \"32B\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"0.6185\",\n            \"0.6092\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"32B 结果将 scale invariance 证据从 ≤8B 扩展至 ≤32B，覆盖 32x 的规模范围。 K*=2 在所有 8 个 C4 web text 配置（含 Mistral K*=1 例外）上保持一致。 论文 limitation 从 \\\"≤8B\\\" 改为 \\\"≤32B\\\"，并保留 \\\"extending to 70B+ is future work\\\"  的措辞。审稿人关于规模局限性的关切从 moderate concern 降为 minor concern。\\n\\n\\nBest 档下：(1) K*=2 在 32B 模型上得到确认，1v2 CI lower=0.6092 > θ=0.60。 这延续了 1.5B→7B→14B→32B 的 scale invariance 趋势。(2) 0v1 AUC 略低于小模型 （0.9515 vs Qwen-1.5B 0.987），因为更大模型生成的文本更接近人类分布， binary 信号稍弱但仍远超阈值。(3) 1v2 AUC (0.6185) 与 14B (0.621) 和 7B (0.618)  非常接近，证明 depth discrimination boundary 不随模型规模单调变化——DPI 理论预测 K* 由信息损失率决定而非模型容量。(4) JSD 和特征排序与小模型一致 （freq_entropy 和 surp_d1_skew 仍为 top discriminators），进一步支持  K* 是文本固有属性而非模型属性的核心论点。(5) 32B 是论文中最大的模型， 虽仍属 ≤32B 范围（不覆盖 70B+），但已将 scale invariance 证据链从 \\\"≤8B\\\"  扩展至 \\\"≤32B\\\"，显著缓解审稿人关于模型规模局限性的关切。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated (what_if: honest negative)\",\n    \"description\": \"将 exp-026 arXiv graduated filtering 的负向结果整合入论文：Section 5 增加 arXiv null result  table，Discussion 增加 \\\"K* characterizes signal discriminability, not data utility\\\" 洞察。 评估 honest negative 对审稿分数和论文可信度的影响。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"section5_arXiv_null_table\": {\n        \"strategies\": [\n          \"no_filter\",\n          \"binary\",\n          \"graduated_α0.9\"\n        ],\n        \"mmlu\": {\n          \"no_filter\": \"0.5899±0.0008\",\n          \"binary\": \"0.5876±0.0004\",\n          \"graduated\": \"0.5900±0.0011\"\n        },\n        \"hellaswag\": {\n          \"no_filter\": \"0.6600±0.0002\",\n          \"binary\": \"0.6642±0.0004\",\n          \"graduated\": \"0.6599±0.0003\"\n        },\n        \"paired_ttest_graduated_vs_nofilter\": {\n          \"mmlu_p\": 0.89,\n          \"hellaswag_p\": 0.71\n        },\n        \"verdict\": \"graduated ≈ no_filter (all p > 0.24)\"\n      },\n      \"exp025_pythia_null_appendix\": {\n        \"delta_max\": 0.0017,\n        \"verdict\": \"all strategies within noise\"\n      },\n      \"discussion_insight\": \"K* characterizes the information-theoretic boundary of depth signal  discriminability, not the boundary of training data utility. Depth 2-3  arXiv text is statistically distinguishable (K*=3) but removing it does  not improve downstream performance — the discriminable signal does not  correspond to quality degradation at these depths.\\n\",\n      \"credibility_boost_estimated\": 0.75,\n      \"reviewer_response_predicted\": {\n        \"positive_framing\": \"\\\"The authors commendably report negative results on graduated filtering  (exp-026) and cross-model filtering (exp-025), providing a nuanced picture  that strengthens the paper's scientific contribution.\\\"\\n\",\n        \"c3_acceptance_shift\": \"+0.10 (from 0.70 to 0.80)\",\n        \"soundness_boost\": \"+0.25 (honest methodology)\"\n      },\n      \"impact_on_scores\": {\n        \"avg_reviewer_score_delta\": \"+0.15\",\n        \"soundness_delta\": \"+0.25\",\n        \"substance_delta\": \"+0.10\",\n        \"venue_acceptance_prob_delta\": \"+0.05\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table (Section 5): arXiv Domain Filtering — Null Result\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Strategy\",\n          \"MMLU\",\n          \"HellaSwag\",\n          \"Δ MMLU vs no-filter\",\n          \"Δ HellaSwag vs no-filter\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"No filter\",\n            \"0.5899±0.0008\",\n            \"0.6600±0.0002\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Binary (K*-aware)\",\n            \"0.5876±0.0004\",\n            \"0.6642±0.0004\",\n            \"-0.0023*\",\n            \"+0.0042***\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Graduated (α=0.9)\",\n            \"0.5900±0.0011\",\n            \"0.6599±0.0003\",\n            \"+0.0001\",\n            \"-0.0001\"\n          ]\n        ],\n        \"footnotes\": [\n          \"* p=0.005 (paired t-test, 5 seeds); *** p<0.00001\",\n          \"Graduated ≈ no-filter on both metrics (MMLU p=0.89, HellaSwag p=0.71)\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table (Appendix): Pythia-1.4B Filtering — Model-Scale Sensitivity\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Strategy\",\n          \"MMLU\",\n          \"HellaSwag\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"No filter\",\n            \"0.2568±0.0012\",\n            \"0.5250±0.0008\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Binary\",\n            \"0.2585±0.0004\",\n            \"0.5251±0.0001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Graduated (α=0.9)\",\n            \"0.2561±0.0009\",\n            \"0.5253±0.0007\"\n          ]\n        ],\n        \"footnotes\": [\n          \"All deltas within noise (max Δ=0.0017). Pythia-1.4B MMLU baseline near random (0.257), suggesting model capacity floor masks filtering effects.\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Honest negative integration 是 best 档的关键差异化因素。审稿人在 best 档下不仅 不惩罚负向结果，反而给予可信度加分。核心机制：(1) C3 claim 的精确化——从  over-broad \\\"K* predicts optimal curation\\\" 到 nuanced \\\"K* predicts discriminability  boundary; curation utility depends on domain-specific quality-depth coupling\\\"； (2) 概念贡献的增加——\\\"K* ≠ data utility\\\" 成为 Discussion 的独立贡献点； (3) 论文完整性——读者不需要猜测 \\\"graduated filtering 在其他域是否有效\\\"， 因为论文已经系统测试并报告了答案。这种透明度在 EMNLP 审稿文化中尤其受重视。\\n\\nBest 档下，honest negatives 产生显著的可信度提升效应： (1) exp-026 arXiv null result 被审稿人视为负责任的科学态度。在 ML 领域，报告负向结果 仍然稀缺，这种做法本身就是差异化信号。审稿人对 C3 的接受度从 0.70 升至 0.80， 因为 C3 的 claim 从 \\\"graduated filtering is universally better\\\" 调整为更精确的  \\\"binary K*-aware filtering is the appropriate granularity for web text (K*=2);  on domains with higher K* (arXiv, K*=3), the additional depth information  does not translate to downstream utility gains\\\"——这是一个更有 nuance 也更可信的叙事。 (2) Discussion 中的 \\\"K* ≠ data utility\\\" 洞察被审稿人视为 conceptual contribution， 因为它区分了信息论意义上的可区分性和实际训练价值——这是一个非显然但重要的观察， 为 K* 的理论定位提供了更精确的边界。(3) exp-025 Pythia null 放 Appendix 作为  model-scale sensitivity 分析，审稿人注意到但不视为主线缺陷，因为 Pythia-1.4B  在 MMLU 上的 base performance (0.2568) 本身就接近 random，filtering 效果被  model capacity floor 掩盖是合理的解释。(4) 综合影响：honest negatives 将论文 从 \\\"we prove everything works\\\" 的可疑叙事转为 \\\"we carefully characterize what works  and what doesn't\\\"，这在 characterization study 的定位下尤其有效。预估 soundness  提升 0.25 分（从 3.5-4.0 范围的下端移向上端），整体接收概率提升约 5pp。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":434,"startLine":1,"totalLines":434}}}
